            "review_title": "Review at Nash Tapas & Wine bar",
            "review_text": "Simon P\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam111 contributions\n1\nBrand New - many rooms for improvement\nSep 2016 • Friends\nWith great location but quite hidden through the alley way, by the unfinished hotel construction site, there is Nash restaurant. Nash has a modern vibe, great decorations and high ceiling, therefor it feels very spacious and nice inside. A group of us (10) came in to have a drink after dinner - maybe there were too many of us so the waiter was overwhelm and didn't take the order correctly. We waited for 45 minutes for some drinks, and one came back as not available so its quite unpleasant. The waiter / bartender could have checked and come back to us sooner to re-order. Haven't tried the food but hopefully its good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 13, 2016",
